hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1091","Chapter on the stern warning against the treacherous, 1129 - Muhammad ibn Yahya and al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani narrated to us; they said: Muhammad ibn Ubayd narrated to us, he said: Ubayd Allah narrated to us, from Nafi', from Ibn Umar (may Allah be pleased with them), who said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: When Allah gathers the first and the last on the Day of Resurrection, a banner will be raised for every treacherous one, and it will be said: This is the treachery of so-and-so. The wording of the hadith is that of Ibn Yahya; al-Za'farani did not mention: on the Day of Resurrection."
